REQUIRES: cmake-ninja
UNSUPPORTED: system-darwin

A C++20 modules build (CMake scans each source for module dependencies, then
compiles with a module map): one entry per source, carrying its flags.
macOS is unsupported: Apple's clang comes without clang-scan-deps.

RUN: %e2e prepare modules %t
RUN: cmake -S %t -B %t/build -G Ninja
RUN: %catter script::cdb -q -o %t/compile_commands.json -- cmake --build %t/build
RUN: %e2e summarize --brief %t/compile_commands.json %t | FileCheck %s

CHECK: entries: 2
CHECK-NEXT: other entries: 0
CHECK-NEXT: missing sources: 0
CHECK-NEXT: without define: 0
CHECK-NEXT: unexpanded response files: 0
